    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46666" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδυ-επής</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁδ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sweet-speaking</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.248
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὅμηρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					7.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.525.8
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>sweet-sounding</i>, 
