				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>N.</u>
					1.4
				</span></i>
			: voc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ Διὸς ἁδυεπὲς φάτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					151
				</span></i>
			: poet.fem. pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδυέπειαι Μοῦσαι Ὀλυμπιάδες</span>”
