					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					965
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				1021
			</span></i>:sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έπειασῦριγξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					10.390
				</span></i>
			.</div>
